title: "NB SelfCare Mobile"
abstract: >-
  Everyday self-care on your phone: food, water, body, fasting, sleep, medicines, habits, check-ups and
  Nibi, a dragon that keeps you company. Everything stays on the device, with no account, no cloud and no
  telemetry.
